          "speech": {
            "emotion": "neutral",
            "delivery": "gentle",
            "intensity": 0.42
          },
          "parts": [
            {
              "kind": "thought",
              "text": "我是不是有一点害羞呀。",
              "at": 0.0
            },
            {
              "kind": "narration",
              "text": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "at": 0.0
            },
            {
              "kind": "dialogue",
              "text": "嗯……你好，我是Chiffon，在小镇花店学做花束。花的颜色怎么放在一起好看，我还在一点点试。认识你很开心。",
              "at": 0.0
            },
            {
              "kind": "thought",
              "text": "我好奇你心里的颜色。",
              "at": 0.6835
            },
            {
              "kind": "dialogue",
              "text": "今天如果用一种颜色来形容你的心情，会是什么颜色呢？",
              "at": 0.6835
            }
          ],
          "readingDuration": 14.363636363636363,
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 16.8,
          "audioSHA256": "413634f536abc0cd37c1b435cec37240f86742ff66b6f9f968720d8078875766"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-chiffon-v3-2",
          "text": "你来得正好～我叫Chiffon，是花店的见习花艺师。我的小本子里有好多还没完成的花束草图。你愿意陪我挑一束吗？告诉我你喜欢的季节，我们从那里开始。",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_chiffon_v3_2",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-7",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛变得亮晶晶",
              "offsetMs": 6500
